# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# oradba-labs - target levels: what "current" means for the dictionary labs
# (dict26, dict19). Read by common/scripts/dict_snapshot.sh, never sourced.
# Maintained monthly after each CPU / CSPU by the KB-skill sync
# (~/notes/prompts/kb-skill-sync.md). Format: KEY=value, one per line.
# Keys per release REL (26AI, 19C):
#   TARGET_<REL>_VERSION     version_full the lab should reach (compared numerically)
#   TARGET_<REL>_CSPU_DATE   release date of the current CSPU; a SQL patch applied on
#                            or after it must be in DBA_REGISTRY_SQLPATCH (empty = no CSPU)
#   BEHIND_NOTE_<REL>        why the lab is behind, shown with the flag (empty = no note)
# Source: delphi-oradba domains/security/topics/critical-patch-updates/
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
UPDATED=2026-11-25
CPU=CPU October 2026
TARGET_26AI_VERSION=23.26.4.0.0
TARGET_26AI_CSPU_DATE=
BEHIND_NOTE_26AI=Free image 23.26.4 has a container issue (no dbca template, setup does not run) - waiting for oradba-labs / Oracle
TARGET_19C_VERSION=19.33.0.0.0
TARGET_19C_CSPU_DATE=2026-11-17
BEHIND_NOTE_19C=19.33 + CSPU 2026-11 needs the 19c EE image from the future oradba-docker repo via orarepo - not available yet
# --- EOF ----------------------------------------------------------------------
